	)
	(text_box "The power status of each USB port can be determined by directly sensing the VBUS of J1 and J101 through simple resistor dividers into the 3.3V domain. This approach avoids back-feeding risks, eliminates the need for open-collector pull-up handling, and provides an unambiguous indication of which USB port is active.\n"
